    {
      "id": "text_d0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 462,
      "width": 1396,
      "height": 95,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2142411094,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2103413542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET /v1/insights/usage?group_by=org_unit|member|model|tool&window=…&scope=…\nThe scope argument is intersected with the caller's visibility set on the server. A caller who asks for an org unit they\ncannot see gets 403 with reason scope_outside_grant — never an empty chart, which would read as 'no usage'.\nPayload fields are omitted unless the caller holds payload:reveal and a valid approval; the response says which fields\nwere withheld and why, so the UI can render a lock with an explanation instead of a blank cell.",
      "originalText": "GET /v1/insights/usage?group_by=org_unit|member|model|tool&window=…&scope=…\nThe scope argument is intersected with the caller's visibility set on the server. A caller who asks for an org unit they\ncannot see gets 403 with reason scope_outside_grant — never an empty chart, which would read as 'no usage'.\nPayload fields are omitted unless the caller holds payload:reveal and a valid approval; the response says which fields\nwere withheld and why, so the UI can render a lock with an explanation instead of a blank cell.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
