      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The bootstrap response returns the navigation manifest for this caller.\nA module the caller cannot use is absent, not present-and-broken.\nThis removes the whole class of 'click a tab, get 403, see a red box'.\nDeep links to a hidden module render a purposeful 'request access' page.",
